<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Greetings Robert Samuel White,<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Thank you for applying to be a volunteer with Oregon=
