rements. Please keep in mind that you must complete several more steps befo=
re officially being accepted into the volunteer program. The steps are deta=
iled below.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">*Note &#8211; Please continue working with Franki Al=
legra as you may have already completed some of the steps below.<o:p></o:p>=
</p>
