Receive keys, handbooks, equipment and resources to perform duties.<o:p></o=
:p></li></ol>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">*Volunteer uniforms, an en route pass and your host =
sign will be provided at your first park location. You will keep these for =
each assignment thereafter. En route passes are renewed each year during an=
nual registration.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">In the meantime, should you have any changes to your=
 application, please email us at
